flowchart LR
    Dev["👨‍💻 <b>Git Push / PR</b><br/>(GitHub Flow)"]
    Lint["🔍 <b>Build & Static Check</b><br/>Compile + Linter +<br/>OpenAPI Schema Lint"]
    Test["🧪 <b>Automated Testing</b><br/>Unit Tests (Domain/SOLID)<br/>+ Testcontainers PostgreSQL"]
    Sec["🛡️ <b>Quality & Security</b><br/>SonarQube Coverage ≥ 85%<br/>+ Trivy Container Scan"]
    Img["🐳 <b>Docker Registry</b><br/>Build Multi-stage Image<br/>Push GHCR (Tag SHA)"]
    Stg["🚀 <b>Deploy Staging</b><br/>Auto DB Migration (Flyway)<br/>+ E2E API Smoke Tests"]
    Prod["🏛️ <b>Production Release</b><br/>Rolling Update Zero-Downtime<br/>+ Prometheus Monitoring"]

    Dev --> Lint --> Test --> Sec --> Img --> Stg --> Prod

